@startuml
title Отмена записи

actor "Администратор" as Admin
boundary "UI" as UI
control "AppointmentUseCase" as UseCase
entity "AppointmentRepository" as Appointments
entity "ScheduleRepository" as Schedule
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Admin -> UI: выбирает запись и нажимает отмену
UI -> UseCase: CancelAppointment(appointmentId)
UseCase -> Appointments: GetByID(appointmentId)
Appointments -> DB: SELECT appointment
DB --> Appointments: appointment
Appointments --> UseCase: appointment
UseCase -> Appointments: Cancel(appointmentId)
Appointments -> DB: UPDATE appointment status
DB --> Appointments: ok
UseCase -> Schedule: ReleaseSlot(slotId)
Schedule -> DB: UPDATE slot status
DB --> Schedule: ok
UseCase --> UI: cancelled appointment DTO
UI --> Admin: запись отменена

@enduml
